    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44073" root="&#xA;                        نغو&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            3
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاغَاهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He interchanged speech with him,
each of them addressing the other with a word</i>
or <i>saying:</i> (TA:) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَغَيْتُ إِلَيْهِ نَغْيَةٌ</span> signifies <i>I
addressed to him a word</i> or <i>saying:</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُنَاغَاةُ</span>
signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُوَاجَهَةُ</span>. (JK.)

